## Exit criteria
- [ ] Record once where existing policy and diagnostic/source infrastructure live and what integration gaps remain.
- [ ] All three children closed, with reusable on-demand diagnostics and controls; no routine healthcheck or merge-gate wiring.
- [ ] Integration review per roar step 8 verifies the three diagnostics compose without introducing new general rules or treating unavailable evidence as a clean audit.
